  "torConnected": "Connected via Tor",
  "torFailed": "Tor connection failed — retrying…",

  "helpTorTitle": "Why do I have to wait for \"connecting via Tor\"?",
  "helpTorBody": "This app sends all its traffic through Tor, a worldwide network of volunteer-run servers that hides your IP address by routing your connection through a few relays. Because of that, the server can never see where or which device you're connecting from. This happens automatically every time you open the app — you don't need to do anything, just wait for the icon at the top to change from a loading circle to a shield."
